WEBVTT

00:00:00.663 --> 00:00:01.349
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.353 --> 00:00:04.476
<v><b>Speaker A:</b></v> Have you finished your homework <b>yet</b>?

00:00:04.855 --> 00:00:06.399
<v><b>Speaker B:</b></v> No, not <b>yet</b>.

00:00:06.694 --> 00:00:08.108
I haven’t finished <b>yet</b>.

00:00:10.113 --> 00:00:10.727
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:11.741 --> 00:00:14.506
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> My sister’s <b>just</b> started a new job.

00:00:16.565 --> 00:00:17.310
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:18.307 --> 00:00:20.016
<v><b>Speaker A:</b></v> Do you want to see this film?

00:00:20.492 --> 00:00:23.782
<v><b>Speaker B:</b></v> No, I’ve <b>already</b> seen it three times.